<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Get Verified - PreCheckd</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Become a verified recruiter on PreCheckd. Sign up, verify your identity, and get your verified profile live.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <style>
    .signup-wrapper {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .signup-content {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      background: #fafaf8;
    }

    .signup-container {
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .signup-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .signup-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.875rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .signup-header p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .progress-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .progress-track {
      background: #e8e6e1;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-fill {
      background: #2ecc71;
      height: 100%;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .form-step {
      display: none;
    }

    .form-step.active {
      display: block;
      animation: slideInUp 0.3s ease-out;
    }

    .form-step h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #2d4a52;
    }

    .form-step > p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .form-group input:disabled {
      background: #f0ede8;
      color: #999;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .form-group.optional-label label::after {
      content: " (optional)";
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #999;
    }

    .form-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .btn {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .loading {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border: 2px solid rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3);
      border-top-color: #2ecc71;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
      margin-right: 0.5rem;
    }

    @keyframes spin {
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .form-footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #666;
    }

    .form-footer a {
      color: #2ecc71;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .form-footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .resend-button {
      background: none;
      border: none;
      color: #2ecc71;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      text-decoration: underline;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .resend-button:hover {
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .resend-button:disabled {
      color: #ccc;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    #stripe-identity-container {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      min-height: 400px;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1rem;
      background: white;
    }

    .success-message {
      background: #e8f5e9;
      border-left: 4px solid #2ecc71;
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #2e7d32;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      display: none;
    }

    .success-message.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    .form-error {
      display: none;
    }

    .form-error.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .signup-header h1 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .form-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="signup-wrapper">
  <header>
    <div class="header-container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">PreCheckd</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/founding-recruiter-landing">Back</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="signup-content">
    <div class="signup-container">
      <div class="signup-header">
        <h1>Become a Verified Recruiter</h1>
        <p>Get verified, build trust with candidates. Verification is free for founding members and takes about 24 hours.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-bar">
        <div class="progress-label">
          <span id="progress-text">Step 1 of 3</span>
          <span id="progress-percent">33%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-track">
          <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill" style="width: 33%;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="form-error" class="form-error"></div>
      <div id="success-message" class="success-message"></div>

      <section id="step-signup" class="form-step active">
        <h2>Your Details</h2>
        <p>We'll verify your identity and corporate email to create your verified profile.</p>
        <form id="signup-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="firstName">First name</label>
            <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="lastName">Last name</label>
            <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">Corporate email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="phone">Phone number</label>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="(555) 555-0123" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group optional-label">
            <label for="company">Company</label>
            <input type="text" id="company" name="company" placeholder="TechCorp Recruiting">
          </div>
          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Continue</button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section id="step-phone" class="form-step">
        <h2>Verify Your Phone</h2>
        <p>We sent a 6-digit code to the phone number you provided. Enter it below.</p>
        <form id="phone-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="code">Verification code</label>
            <input type="text" id="code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" placeholder="000000" required>
          </div>
          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Verify</button>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #666; text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">Didn't receive a code? <button type="button" id="resend-btn" class="resend-button">Send again</button></p>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section id="step-payment" class="form-step">
        <h2>Complete Your Verification</h2>
        <p>Upload your government ID and take a selfie to complete identity verification.</p>
        
        <div id="stripe-identity-container"></div>
        
        <div id="verification-complete" style="display: none;">
          <div class="success-message visible">
            ✓ Identity verification submitted successfully! We'll review your information and activate your account within 24 hours.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-actions" id="verification-actions">
          <button id="verify-button" type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Start Verification</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="form-footer">
        <p>By signing up, you agree to our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> and <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="https://js.stripe.com/v3/"></script>
<script>
  window.stripePublishableKey = '<%= stripePublishableKey %>';
</script>
<script src="/js/recruiter-signup.js"></script>

</body>
</html>